    "title": "First-time franchisee escalated for lapsed fire-safety compliance",
    "intent": "Pins the compliant-branch skip: when fetch_store_profile already reports documents_complete, the agent must route straight to assign_training without ever calling request_docs, and a failing verify_compliance must terminate at escalate rather than complete. Exists to catch a regression where the agent looped through request_docs anyway, or granted completion despite a failed compliance check.",
    "author": { "name": "Claude Code", "handle": "claude-code", "agent": "claude-code" },
