  "narrative": "Arun Deshpande is opening his very first store, a single unit in Whitefield. His paperwork was already complete when the franchise desk did the intake, so when the agent reads the store profile there is nothing outstanding to chase and no reason to loop through request_docs. Training is assigned at the full six-module set appropriate for a first-time operator with no prior locations. But the compliance check turns up a lapsed fire-safety certificate and an overdue inspection, so onboarding cannot complete: the run is escalated to regional operations with both findings still outstanding.",

